 "text": "Hey, nice haircut. Is it new? Bags that go around your neck when you' off the ride. A light bag each for shopping and cooking works too. A basket on the front is heavy and pulls the front end down. It works best with a heavy load. Then a basket is probably not worth it. Use two bags back to back for the shop, and save the big bag for the rest of the week. They work, but they limit your hands free to the handlebars. You can't use your grocery bag holders.",
